{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_adr", "label": "Journal des d\u00e9cisions d'architecture (ADR)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/ADR.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_001", "label": "ADR-001 \u2014 Architecture client-serveur (sans mode hors-ligne)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/ADR.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Local-first/CRDT \u00e9cart\u00e9 comme sur-ing\u00e9nierie : la synchro et la r\u00e9solution de conflits sont la partie la plus risqu\u00e9e ; usage au domicile avec r\u00e9seau disponible. La PWA pr\u00e9serve la porte pour un offline ult\u00e9rieur."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_002", "label": "ADR-002 \u2014 H\u00e9bergement auto-g\u00e9r\u00e9 (self-hosted) plut\u00f4t que BaaS", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/ADR.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Contr\u00f4le des donn\u00e9es, absence de vendor lock-in et objectif explicite de mont\u00e9e en comp\u00e9tence ops ; contrepartie : l'auteur porte l'exploitation et la s\u00e9curit\u00e9 de l'auth expos\u00e9e."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_003", "label": "ADR-003 \u2014 S\u00e9paration frontend/backend via un contrat d'API REST", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/ADR.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Monorepo, deux applications, fronti\u00e8re = contrat REST. L'auteur ma\u00eetrise C# mais pas le frontend ; le contrat est le point de stabilit\u00e9 et permet de d\u00e9l\u00e9guer le front. Blazor full-stack \u00e9cart\u00e9 au profit de l'\u00e9cosyst\u00e8me UI JS."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_004", "label": "ADR-004 \u2014 Backend en ASP.NET Core (C#)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/ADR.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Capitalise sur la comp\u00e9tence existante de l'auteur ; framework mature, conteneurisable, \u00e9cosyst\u00e8me int\u00e9gr\u00e9 (EF Core, Identity)."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_005", "label": "ADR-005 \u2014 Frontend en Vue 3 + TypeScript, packag\u00e9 en PWA", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/ADR.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Courbe d'apprentissage douce et documentation excellente pour un non-sp\u00e9cialiste ; React trop raide, Svelte trop restreint, Blazor WASM moins fourni c\u00f4t\u00e9 UI."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_006", "label": "ADR-006 \u2014 Biblioth\u00e8que de composants UI : Vuetify", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/ADR.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Material Design pr\u00eat \u00e0 l'emploi, peu de d\u00e9cisions esth\u00e9tiques pour un auteur non-designer, bonnes zones tactiles pour utilisateurs \u00e2g\u00e9s ; PrimeVue \u00e9cart\u00e9 (plus de design \u00e0 charge), UI sur mesure rejet\u00e9e (co\u00fbt)."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_007", "label": "ADR-007 \u2014 PostgreSQL comme SGBD", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/ADR.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Mod\u00e8le fortement relationnel : la tra\u00e7abilit\u00e9 repose sur des cha\u00eenes de cl\u00e9s \u00e9trang\u00e8res et l'int\u00e9grit\u00e9 r\u00e9f\u00e9rentielle est la valeur m\u00e9tier. SQLite inadapt\u00e9 \u00e0 un service expos\u00e9, NoSQL inadapt\u00e9 au relationnel."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_008", "label": "ADR-008 \u2014 Entity Framework Core + Npgsql comme couche d'acc\u00e8s aux donn\u00e9es", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/ADR.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "ORM standard .NET, mod\u00e8le en classes C# et migrations versionnant le sch\u00e9ma ; Dapper et SQL brut \u00e9cart\u00e9s au profit de la productivit\u00e9 et d'un apprentissage structur\u00e9."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_009", "label": "ADR-009 \u2014 Authentification JWT adoss\u00e9e \u00e0 ASP.NET Core Identity", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/ADR.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Access token JWT 15 min en m\u00e9moire + refresh token 30 jours hach\u00e9 en base et transmis par cookie httpOnly/Secure Path=/api/auth ; rotation avec d\u00e9tection de rejeu, fail-closed par FallbackPolicy, aucune inscription publique (compte seed\u00e9). localStorage rejet\u00e9 (XSS), refresh stateless rejet\u00e9 (pas de r\u00e9vocation)."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_010", "label": "ADR-010 \u2014 D\u00e9ploiement conteneuris\u00e9 (Docker Compose + reverse proxy HTTPS)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/ADR.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Environnements reproductibles, HTTPS automatis\u00e9 via Caddy/Let's Encrypt, progression ops ; d\u00e9ploiement sans conteneurs et PaaS \u00e9cart\u00e9s."}, {"id": "docs_adr_refresh_token", "label": "Table refresh_token (hash SHA-256, rotation, r\u00e9vocation)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/ADR.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_access_token_jwt", "label": "Access token JWT en m\u00e9moire (15 min, HMAC-SHA256)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/ADR.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_rotation_detection_rejeu", "label": "Rotation du refresh token avec d\u00e9tection de rejeu", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/ADR.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_fail_closed_policy", "label": "Politique d'autorisation fail-closed (FallbackPolicy)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/ADR.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_seed_compte_admin", "label": "Compte unique seed\u00e9 au d\u00e9marrage (Seed:AdminEmail/AdminPassword)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/ADR.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_cookie_samesite_lax", "label": "SameSite=Lax du cookie de refresh (tranch\u00e9 par la topologie same-origin)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/ADR.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_pile_technique", "label": "Synth\u00e8se de la pile technique retenue", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/ADR.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_contrat_openapi", "label": "Contrat d'API REST document\u00e9 via OpenAPI/Swagger", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/ADR.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_monorepo", "label": "Monorepo frontend/backend", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/ADR.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_reverse_proxy_caddy", "label": "Reverse proxy Caddy + HTTPS Let's Encrypt", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/ADR.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, 